### DamarBağış — elle deneme koleksiyonu (VS Code REST Client)
### Sırayla çalıştırın: giriş istekleri belirteçleri değişkenlere yazar.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@pw = Demo1234!

### Sağlık
GET {{base}}/health

### Metrikler
GET {{base}}/metrics

### OpenAPI
GET {{base}}/openapi.yaml

# ───────────── Giriş (her rol) ─────────────

# @name admin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@damarbagis.local","password":"{{pw}}"}

###
# @name nurse
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"hemsire@damarbagis.local","password":"{{pw}}"}

###
# @name lab
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lab@damarbagis.local","password":"{{pw}}"}

###
# @name lab2
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"lab2@damarbagis.local","password":"{{pw}}"}

###
# @name bank
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"bankasorumlusu@damarbagis.local","password":"{{pw}}"}

###
# @name hosp
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"hastane@damarbagis.local","password":"{{pw}}"}

###
# @name donor
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"bagisci@damarbagis.local","password":"{{pw}}"}

###
@A = Bearer {{admin.response.body.access_token}}
@N = Bearer {{nurse.response.body.access_token}}
@L = Bearer {{lab.response.body.access_token}}
@L2 = Bearer {{lab2.response.body.access_token}}
@K = Bearer {{bank.response.body.access_token}}
@H = Bearer {{hosp.response.body.access_token}}
@D = Bearer {{donor.response.body.access_token}}

### Yanlış parola → 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@damarbagis.local","password":"yanlis"}

### Refresh (rotasyon)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"{{admin.response.body.refresh_token}}"}

### Yetki ihlali: hastane bağışçı listesine erişemez → 403
GET {{base}}/api/v1/donors
Authorization: {{H}}

### Oturumdaki kullanıcı
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: {{N}}

# ───────────── F-1 Bağışçı kaydı ve uygunluk ─────────────

# @name newDonor
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donors
Authorization: {{N}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: rest-donor-0001

{"first_name":"Elif","last_name":"Deneme","sex":"F","birth_date":"1996-02-14","abo":"A","rh_positive":true,"phone":"+90 555 111 2233",
 "health":{"medications":["levotiroksin"],"conditions":[]}}

###
@donorId = {{newDonor.response.body.id}}

### Uygunluk (uygun)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donors/{{donorId}}/eligibility
Authorization: {{N}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"donation_type":"whole_blood","measurements":{"hemoglobin":13.4,"weight_kg":61}}

### Uygunluk (düşük Hb + seyahat beyanı → gerekçeli red)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donors/{{donorId}}/eligibility
Authorization: {{N}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"measurements":{"hemoglobin":11.8,"weight_kg":61},"declarations":[{"code":"travel_malaria","date":"2026-09-01"}]}

### Bağışçı arama (keyset)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/donors?q=yıl&limit=10
Authorization: {{N}}

### Sağlık verisi — gerekçesiz → 400
GET {{base}}/api/v1/donors/{{donorId}}/health
Authorization: {{N}}

### Sağlık verisi — gerekçeli (denetime yazılır)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/donors/{{donorId}}/health
Authorization: {{N}}
X-Access-Reason: Bağış öncesi muayene ilaç kontrolü

### Erteleme ekle
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donors/{{donorId}}/deferrals
Authorization: {{N}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason_code":"dental","starts_on":"2026-10-01","note":"diş çekimi"}

# ───────────── F-2 Randevu ve bağış ─────────────

### Randevu
# @name appt
POST {{base}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: {{N}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"donor_id":{{donorId}},"scheduled_at":"2026-12-15T09:30:00Z"}

### Bağış kaydı (aynı Idempotency-Key ile iki kez gönderin → aynı yanıt)
# @name donation
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donations
Authorization: {{N}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: rest-donation-0001

{"donor_id":{{donorId}},"volume_ml":450,"hemoglobin":13.4,"weight_kg":61}

###
@donationId = {{donation.response.body.id}}

### İkinci bağış → 422 INTERVAL_NOT_ELAPSED
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donations
Authorization: {{N}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"donor_id":{{donorId}},"volume_ml":450,"hemoglobin":13.4,"weight_kg":61}

# ───────────── F-4 / F-3 Üretim, test, karantina ─────────────

### Bileşen üretimi
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donations/{{donationId}}/components
Authorization: {{L}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Test sonucu (negatif → ürünler stokta)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donations/{{donationId}}/test-results
Authorization: {{L}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"hiv":false,"hbv":false,"hcv":false,"syphilis":false}

### Test sonucu düzeltme talebi (1. onay)
# @name change
POST {{base}}/api/v1/donations/{{donationId}}/test-changes
Authorization: {{L}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"proposed":{"hiv":false,"hbv":true,"hcv":false,"syphilis":false},"reason":"Doğrulama testi reaktif"}

### Aynı kişi onaylayamaz → 403
POST {{base}}/api/v1/test-changes/{{change.response.body.id}}/approve
Authorization: {{L}}

### İkinci uzman onaylar → tüm türevler (bölünmüşler dahil) karantina
POST {{base}}/api/v1/test-changes/{{change.response.body.id}}/approve
Authorization: {{L2}}

### Test bekleyen bağışlar
GET {{base}}/api/v1/donations?pending=tests&limit=10
Authorization: {{L}}

# ───────────── F-5 Stok ─────────────

### Stok matrisi
GET {{base}}/api/v1/stock
Authorization: {{K}}

### Ürünler (A+ eritrosit, FEFO)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products?status=available&component=RBC&group=A%2B&sort=expiry&limit=10
Authorization: {{K}}

### Ürünler (keyset sayfa 1)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products?status=available&limit=5
Authorization: {{K}}

### Uyum sırası (A+ eritrosit)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/compat?component=RBC&group=A%2B
Authorization: {{H}}

# ───────────── F-6 / T-3 Talep ve rezervasyon ─────────────

# @name req
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: {{H}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: rest-request-0001

{"component":"RBC","group":"A+","units":2,"urgency":"urgent","patient_ref":"PRT-2026-0042"}

###
@reqId = {{req.response.body.id}}

### Talep detayı (bağışçı bilgisi içermez)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/requests/{{reqId}}
Authorization: {{H}}

### Çok acil talep
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests
Authorization: {{H}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"component":"RBC","group":"O-","units":1,"urgency":"emergency","patient_ref":"PRT-ACIL-7"}

### Aktif rezervasyonlar
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reservations
Authorization: {{K}}

### Kısa süreli yeniden tahsis (önce rezervasyonu bırakın)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests/{{reqId}}/allocate
Authorization: {{K}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ttl_seconds":5}

# ───────────── F-7 Dağıtım, transfüzyon, rapor ─────────────

### Dağıt
POST {{base}}/api/v1/requests/{{reqId}}/issue
Authorization: {{K}}

### Hastanenin ürünleri
GET {{base}}/api/v1/hospital/products
Authorization: {{H}}

### Transfüzyon (product_no'yu yukarıdaki yanıttan alın)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/transfusions
Authorization: {{H}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"product_no":"P00000001","patient_ref":"PRT-2026-0042"}

### Dönem raporu
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-11-01
Authorization: {{K}}

# ───────────── T-2 Geri izleme ─────────────

### Bağışçı → hasta
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trace/donors/{{donorId}}
Authorization: {{K}}

### Hasta → bağışçı (look-back)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/trace/patients/PRT-2026-0042
Authorization: {{K}}

### Ürün geçmişi (geri alınamaz olaylar)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products/1
Authorization: {{K}}

### Geçersiz geçiş → 409
POST {{base}}/api/v1/products/1/transition
Authorization: {{K}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"to":"available","reason":"geri alma denemesi"}

# ───────────── T-4 Tahmin ─────────────

### Tahmin
GET {{base}}/api/v1/forecast?component=RBC&horizon=7
Authorization: {{K}}

### Backtest (MAPE / WAPE)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/forecast/backtest?component=RBC&days=28
Authorization: {{K}}

### Alarmları değerlendir
POST {{base}}/api/v1/alerts/evaluate
Authorization: {{K}}

### Çağrı listesi
GET {{base}}/api/v1/call-list?group=O-&limit=20
Authorization: {{K}}

# ───────────── Bağışçı ekranı ─────────────

### Kendi profilim
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/donor
Authorization: {{D}}

### Randevu al
POST {{base}}/api/v1/me/appointments
Authorization: {{D}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"scheduled_at":"2026-11-20T10:00:00Z"}

# ───────────── Yönetim ─────────────

### Kullanıcılar
GET {{base}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: {{A}}

### Kural sürümleri
GET {{base}}/api/v1/rules?code=eligibility
Authorization: {{A}}

### Denetim kaydı (sağlık verisi erişimleri)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/audit?action=donor.health.read&limit=20
Authorization: {{A}}

### Canlı akış
GET {{base}}/api/v1/live
Authorization: {{K}}

### Barkod doğrulama
GET {{base}}/api/v1/products/verify?code=P00000001.XXXXXXXXXX
Authorization: {{H}}
